flowchart TD
 A[Suspicious authentication pattern] --> B[Review sign-in events]
 B --> C[Identify account, source, app and outcome]
 C --> D[Check successful sign-ins and timeline]
 D --> E[Review Entra ID audit events]
 E --> F[Review Microsoft 365 workload activity]
 F --> G[Correlate actor, target, IP and timestamps]
 G --> H{Evidence supports malicious activity?}
 H -->|Yes| I[Scope impact and prepare response]
 H -->|Not yet| J[Record gaps and collect evidence]
 H -->|No| K[Document benign or inconclusive result]
 J --> B
 I --> L[Report findings and recommendations]
 K --> L
